# From map_unit_orders' output (France, autumn 1599, turn 107): every unit has orders but the
# Wagon Train in Guadeloupe. The wagon is sentried, Space ends the turn, the AI moves and the
# year turns to Spring 1600 (first two-season year). Every end-of-turn popup is answered.
key s                      # sentry the Wagon Train: nothing left to move, End of Turn
wait 20
key space                  # end the turn
wait 300
key Return                 # War of the Spanish Succession ends: Spain cedes New Spain to the Dutch (Spain withdraws)
wait 60
key Return                 # King increases military spending: Regulars added to the REF
wait 60
key Return                 # Rebel sentiment 50%
wait 60
key Return                 # price of Coats in La Rochelle rises
wait 60
key Return                 # Scout 77 on go-to reaches an Iroquois village: Ask to Speak With Chief (row 0)
wait 60
key Return                 # chief: Expert Fishermen, wants Tools
wait 60
key Return                 # tales of nearby lands: map revealed around the village
wait 60
